WEBVTT

00:00:57.563 --> 00:01:00.697
We have to make the changes
at the global scale

00:01:00.697 --> 00:01:02.630
to truly make a difference,

00:01:02.663 --> 00:01:05.197
and that requires rethinking

00:01:05.197 --> 00:01:07.697
what modern global
sustainability looks like

00:01:07.697 --> 00:01:09.663
and a new kind of environmentalism.

00:01:10.663 --> 00:01:13.230
To be clear, when I talk
about sustainability,

00:01:13.263 --> 00:01:15.630
it's not just about the environment.

00:01:15.663 --> 00:01:17.230
While it's an important piece,

00:01:17.263 --> 00:01:19.297
sustainability is about much more.

00:01:20.463 --> 00:01:24.630
Modern sustainability
is the integration of the environment,

00:01:24.663 --> 00:01:26.963
people and the economy.

00:01:26.997 --> 00:01:29.030
Each of them is needed to thrive.

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:31.363
You cannot have one without the other.